h2 { font-size: 15px; margin: 0 0 8px; } ul { margin: 4px 0 10px; padding-left: 20px; } li { margin-bottom: 3px; }
</style>
<h2>Asobi Review 0.8 (build 604)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>A Grade: On / Grade: Off button in the transport bar.</b> One press shows the picture without the grade and looks; the display transform stays and nothing is cleared, so the next press brings the grade back exactly as it was. It is the same switch as Color &#9656; Bypass Grade &amp; Looks (&#8963;&#8984;B), turned amber while off so an ungraded picture is never mistaken for a graded one.</li>
<li><b>Tear panels off by dragging.</b> Drag the header of the Playlist or Review Grade popup and it becomes a floating window under your cursor, placed wherever you let go. The arrow button still works too.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
